const_eval_arrays_map.nra:6:20: @const function doubled calls Arrays.map, which takes a function; an @const function calls only @const functions, constructors and the std functions of std/string, std/array, std/map, std/int, std/float, std/range, std/char, std/option, std/result, std/regex, std/math, std/bytes, std/fixedarray, std/i8, std/i16, std/i32, std/u8, std/u16, std/u32, std/u64, std/f32 that take no function
